{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/PleaseSupportUs_.png?t=1744209116\" /><strong>Seagulls: Crappy Situation</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded at sea and surrounded by angry seagulls, you must survive endless waves using only a slingshot and water hose. Test your multitasking and strategy skills in this quirky, rogue-lite game with local co-op. Get ready for hilarious chaos and bizarre seagulls!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/AnimGifAttack4.gif?t=1744209116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udea3\u200d Survive the Seagull Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your raft from waves of seagulls. Shoot them down with your slingshot, but watch out\u2014those birds leave a <i>nasty mess</i>. The more you fail, the more you learn!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/Ready_Set_Aim.gif?t=1744209116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc6b<strong>Local Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a friend for split-screen co-op and tackle the bird madness together! It\u2019s more chaotic and way more fun with teammates! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/Shoot-Splitscreen.gif?t=1744209116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd04<strong>\u00a0Rogue-lite elements </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two waves are the same! Random upgrades and play styles make each run unique. Will you survive longer? Try new strategies and adapt to the chaos!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/Rougelite5.gif?t=1744209116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf<strong>\u00a0Aim, Shoot, Upgrade Your Raft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s easy to learn, but seagulls get tougher with each wave. Aim carefully, protect your raft, and collect resources to reinforce it. Unlock  upgrades or find scrap and to survive tougher waves\u2014stronger rafts last longer!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/SplitGif2.gif?t=1744209116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udebf Clean Up the Poop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seagull droppings pile up quickly! Use your water hose to clean up the mess, or risk your raft falling apart. Keep it clean to stay afloat!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/AnimGifClean1.gif?t=1744209116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udd3f Explore the depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive beneath the waves to explore shipwrecks and gather scrap to reinforce your raft. Use the wreckage to upgrade your defenses and keep your raft afloat as the seagull attacks intensify!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/AnimGifExplore.gif?t=1744209116\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/Wishlist_1.png?t=1744209116\" /><strong><i>No seagulls were hurt during this production.</i></strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2843720?t=1744209116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744209116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/48c398cc03451dd801958ee5c14f526828169783/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744209116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/4